      "document_title": "Endoscopic submucosal dissection versus endoscopic mucosal resection for colorectal laterally spreading tumors (> 20 mm): a systematic review and meta-analysis",
      "type": "text",
      "section": "Abstract",
      "merged_headings": [],
      "pages": [
